shortdesc Shade pieces of text
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides a shaded backdrop to a box of text. It
longdesc uses a Metafont font (provided) which generates to appropriate
longdesc shading dependent on the resolution used in the Metafont
longdesc printer parameters.
